{"ID":"20240205170445-srpr1u2","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205170445-srpr1u2","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205170445-srpr1u2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135845-p7oi1lq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611112148-9jqpv70\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240621172822-ewbrss4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"143雄黄","type":"doc","updated":"20240813105043"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206135845-p7oi1lq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135845-p7oi1lq","updated":"20240206135854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于贵州、湖南、湖北等地。\n【性状】\t单斜晶系，单晶体呈细小的柱状、针状，但少见；通常为致密粒状或土状块体。桔红色，条痕呈浅桔红色。金刚光泽，断口为树脂光泽。硬度1.52，密度3.53.6g/cm3。性脆，熔点低。用炭火加热，会冒出有大蒜臭味的白烟。置于阳光下曝晒，会变为黄色的雌黄 (As2S3) 和砷华，不溶于水和盐酸，可溶于硝酸，溶液呈黄色。\n【性味】\t辛，温，有毒。\n【功效】\t解毒杀虫，燥湿祛痰，截疟。用于痈肿疔疮，蛇虫咬伤，虫积腹痛，惊痫，疟疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240206135846-mkwwsjw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135846-mkwwsjw","updated":"20240813103549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135846-k214iap.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813104918-fb19or2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813104918-fb19or2","updated":"20240813105009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 627px;","style":"width: 617px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"雄黄 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/雄黄 4-20240813105009-qo9cksl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 617px;\" parent-style=\"width: 627px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 494px;","style":"width: 484px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"雄黄 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/雄黄 3-20240813104918-sr60gj9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 484px;\" parent-style=\"width: 494px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813104725-r5x8o2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813104725-r5x8o2s","updated":"20240813104729"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 358px;","style":"width: 348px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"雄黄 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/雄黄 1-20240813104725-i8ubnv1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 348px;\" parent-style=\"width: 358px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 835px;","style":"width: 825px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240621172616-9hwkpcp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 825px;\" parent-style=\"width: 835px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240621172822-ewbrss4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240621172822-ewbrss4","updated":"20240813104835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 563px;","style":"width: 553px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"雄黄"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/雄黄-20240621172818-74wpse8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 553px;\" parent-style=\"width: 563px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 656px;","style":"width: 646px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"雄黄 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/雄黄 2-20240813104835-1x4vswu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 646px;\" parent-style=\"width: 656px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240813105022-a5kegfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240813105022-a5kegfz","updated":"20240813105043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：雄黄和雌黄一般相伴而生，有雄黄的地方必定有雌黄；"}]},{"ID":"20240611112311-c9fqdvn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112311-c9fqdvn"}},{"ID":"20240611112337-mim0xd9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112337-mim0xd9","updated":"20240611112345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112337-o8arr82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112337-o8arr82","updated":"20240611112337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112337-f3ww02x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112337-f3ww02x","updated":"20240611112337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主寒热，鼠瘘恶创，疽痔死肌，杀精物，恶鬼，邪气，百虫毒，胜五兵。炼食之，轻食神仙。一名黄食石。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112337-gexk97a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112337-gexk97a","updated":"20240611112337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：雄黄，神农苦，山阴有丹雄黄，生山之阳，故曰雄，是丹之雄，所以名雄黄也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112337-ea06f5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112337-ea06f5w","updated":"20240611112337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生武都敦煌山之阳，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112337-u3wv165","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112337-u3wv165","updated":"20240611112337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《西山经》云：高山其下多雄黄。郭璞云：晋太兴三年，高平郡界有山崩，其中出数千斤雄黄。《抱朴子·仙药》云：雄黄当得武都山所出者，纯而无杂，其赤如鸡冠，光明晔晔乃可用耳，其但纯黄似雄黄，色无赤光者，不任以作仙药，可以合理病药耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112355-r53s1l0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112355-r53s1l0"}},{"ID":"20240611112357-nqp9pqa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112357-nqp9pqa","updated":"20240611112402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112357-y5vmryy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112357-y5vmryy","updated":"20240611112357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"重，解毒，杀虫"}]},{"ID":"20240611112357-2gn2naq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112357-2gn2naq","updated":"20240611112357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛温有毒。得正阳之气，入肝经气分。搜肝强脾，散百节大风，杀百毒，辟鬼魅。治惊痫痰涎，头痛眩晕，暑疟 痢，泄泻积聚（虞雍公道中冒暑，泄痢连月，梦至仙居，延之坐。壁中有词云∶暑毒在脾，湿气连脚，不泄则痢，不痢则疟。独炼雄黄，蒸饼和药，甘草作汤，食之安乐。别作治疗，医家大错。如方服之遂愈）。又能化血为水，燥湿杀虫，治劳疳疮疥蛇伤。赤似鸡冠，明彻不臭，重三五两者良。醋浸，入莱菔汁煮，干用。生山阴者名雌黄，功用略同。劣者名熏黄，烧之则臭，只堪熏疮疥，杀虫虱。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112424-i5znh31","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112424-i5znh31"}},{"ID":"20240611112425-yu36cw4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-yu36cw4","updated":"20240611112431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-e838rht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-e838rht","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」亦名黄金石、石黄、熏黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-pgp6ya9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-pgp6ya9","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」夺、平、寒、有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-fsas4zr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-fsas4zr","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-137g9hy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-137g9hy","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、骨蒸发热（按：即今之肺结核）。用雄黄一两，加入小便一升中。另取方圆尺的石板一块，以炭火烧热，把雄黄尿汁淋在石上，垫上薄毡，令病人解衣顶被坐石上，勿使漏风。几次之后，病状即逐渐减轻。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-wcxt7v3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-wcxt7v3","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、伤寒咳逆。用雄黄一钱、酒一杯，同煎，病人趁热嗅其气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-7yk101x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-7yk101x","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、阴部蚀烂，痛痒不已。用雄黄半两烧于瓶中，熏下部，有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-x1ba02p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-x1ba02p","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、偏头风。用雄黄、细辛，等分研细。每次取二、三分吹入鼻中，左痛吹右，右痛吹左。此方名“至灵散”。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-tizetau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-tizetau","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、腹胁痞块。用雄黄、白矾各一两，共研为末，加而糊调成膏，摊纸上，贴痞块处。贴至大便畅泄乃愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-ztt5x6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-ztt5x6c","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、胁下痃癖（按：胁下觉有积聚，呼吸时常抽痛）。用雄黄一两、巴豆五钱，同研细。加白面二两，滴水做成丸子，如梧子大。每服二十四丸。以开过几次再放冷以后的水冲服。大便畅通，病即转好。此方名“煮黄丸”。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-wz854iv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-wz854iv","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、酒癖（饮酒过度引起头晕、恶心、呕吐，长期不愈）。用皂角子大的雄黄六小块、巴豆（连皮油）十五个、蝎子尾巴十五个，共研为末，加面粉五两半，滴水做成丸子，如豌豆大。丸子将干时放于麸中炒香。炒后，取丸子放水里观察。凡是浮在水面的就是好的，收存起来。每服二丸，温酒送下。此方名“酒征丸”。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-5chajyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-5chajyt","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、油癖（特别喜欢吃油，缺油即病）。用雄黄半两，研末，水调服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-dpvokrn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-dpvokrn","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、症瘕积聚。用雄黄二两，研细。水飞九次，放入新竹筒中，以蒸饼一块封住筒口，蒸七次。再用上等粉脂一两，和成丸子，如绿豆大。每服七丸。酒送下。一天服三次。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-rh8sbfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-rh8sbfu","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、阴肿。用雄黄、矾石各二两，甘草一尺，加水五升，煮成二升，浸肿处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-l9x43hm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-l9x43hm","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11、食物中毒。用雄黄、青黛，等分为末，每服二钱，新汲水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-0pgof42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-0pgof42","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12、虫毒。用雄黄、生矾等分，加蜡做成丸药，如梧子大。每服七丸，开水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-pv7bf0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-pv7bf0m","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13、便血。用雄黄不拘多少，放入枣内，用线捆好，煎汤。另用铅一两，熔化后，倒入汤中同煮。自早至晚，不断添开水。煮毕，取出研细，做成丸子，如梧子大。每服三十丸，空心服。用原有的铅汤送下。三服血止。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-5rdvuc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-5rdvuc5","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14、暑天泄痢。用雄黄水飞九次，放在竹铅内蒸七次，研末，与蒸饼混合，做成丸子，如梧子大。每服七丸，甘草汤送下。一天服三次有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-0p6h7j5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-0p6h7j5","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"15、疯狗咬伤。用雄黄五钱、麝香二钱，研细，酒送下。分二次服完。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-ijbz3ev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-ijbz3ev","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"16、百虫入耳。烧雄黄熏耳内，虫自出。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-ghuzkn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-ghuzkn9","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"17、马汗疮（按：牧马人多生这种疮，初起肿痛，后感烦热，重者可致死）。用雄黄、白矾各一钱，乌梅三个，巴豆一个，合研为末，油调敷疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-ky6v0h3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-ky6v0h3","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"18、刀伤。用雄黄一粒，半豆大，放入伤口内，另取雄黄五钱，小便送服。凡刀伤感染，毒入内部者，服此药有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-4tiwia2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-4tiwia2","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"19、打伤发肿。用雄黄二分、密陀僧一分，共研为末，水调敷伤处。极见效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-zaaebru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-zaaebru","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20、白秃头疮。用雄黄、猪胆汁调匀敷上。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-5f18rhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-5f18rhk","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"21、眉毛脱落。用雄黄末一两，调醋搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-i32s4i1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-i32s4i1","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"22、疔疮恶毒。先用针剌毒疮的四边及中心，再以雄黄粉敷上。又方：用雄黄、蟾蜍各五分，共研为末，和葱、蜜捣丸，如小米大。以针剌破疮顶，将药插入。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-jhdrzcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-jhdrzcv","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"23、喉痹（按：此即喉风。喉部不能吞咽，气闭欲死）。用雄黄磨新汲水一盏灌下，吐出恶物即愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-6owugne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-6owugne","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"24、牙痛。用雄黄和枣肉，捏成小丸，塞牙齿空洞中。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-3effrkx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-3effrkx","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"25、走马牙疳，臭烂出血。用豆大的雄黄七粒，每粒包入一个去了核了的淮枣中，再用铁丝把枣子穿成一串，烧化为末。每次取少量搽患处，让涎流出。搽药至病愈为止。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-7i3bkue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-7i3bkue","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"26、耳流脓汁。用雄黄、雌黄、硫磺，等分为末，吹耳内。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-0rfgodz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-0rfgodz","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"27、多年臁疮。用雄黄二钱、陈皮五钱，卷入布中成精捻子，烧烟熏疮，令热水流出。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112425-i2pcoyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112425-i2pcoyg","updated":"20240611112425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"28、红鼻头。用雄黄、硫磺各五钱，水粉二钱，乳汁调敷。三、五次后可愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112435-2fksuob","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112435-2fksuob"}},{"ID":"20240611112440-zt48qqc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112440-zt48qqc","updated":"20240611112445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112440-hkurkha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112440-hkurkha","updated":"20240611112440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（石）散结行气杀虫辟恶"}]},{"ID":"20240611112440-82z1d29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112440-82z1d29","updated":"20240611112440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄（专入胃肝）。生山之阳。得气之正。味辛而苦。气温有毒。凡人阳气虚则邪易侵。阴气胜则鬼易凭。负二气之精者。能破群妖。受阳气之正者。能辟幽暗。故能治寒热鼠 。恶疮疽痔。死肌疥虫 疮诸症。皆由湿热侵于肌肉而成。服此辛以散结。温以行气。辛温相合而虫杀。故能搜剔百节中风寒积聚也！是以圣惠方之治狐惑。（雄黄半两。烧于瓶中。即止。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112440-kyik0km","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112440-kyik0km","updated":"20240611112440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肘后方之治阴肿如斗。（雄黄矾石各二两。甘草一尺。水浸。）家秘方之消疟母。急救方之治风狗咬伤。圣济之治白秃头疮。（雄黄猪胆汁和敷之。）何一不用雄黄以为调治。（虞雍公允文感暑下痢。连月不瘥。忆壁间有药方。其辞云。暑毒在脾。湿气连脚。不泄则痢。不痢则疟。独炼雄黄。蒸饼和药。别作治疗。医家大错。公依方服愈。）至云能解蛇虺藜芦等毒。以其蛇属阴物。藜属阴草也。（宗 曰。焚之蛇皆远去。）息肉癖气能治者。以其一属气结。一属积滞也。目痛能愈者。以其肝得辛散之意也。明彻不臭者良。醋浸。入莱菔汁煮干用。生山阴者名雌黄。功用略同。劣者名熏黄。烧之则臭。止可熏疮疥。杀虫虱。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112450-jbb2aen","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112450-jbb2aen"}},{"ID":"20240611112451-5jrdv9t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112451-5jrdv9t","updated":"20240611112455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112451-n3m6wb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112451-n3m6wb4","updated":"20240611112451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平寒。主寒热。鼠。恶创。疽痔。死肌。杀精物。恶鬼邪气。百虫毒胜五兵。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112451-19rkw2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112451-19rkw2u","updated":"20240611112451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炼食之。轻身神仙。一名黄金石。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112451-4ur4ht0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112451-4ur4ht0","updated":"20240611112451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"丹雄蕴石。精结阳峦。五兵制胜。百毒除残。威申虎爪。色映鸡冠。桃枝辟禳。怪祟奚千。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112451-xsuw08g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112451-xsuw08g","updated":"20240611112451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吴普曰。生山之阳。是丹之雄。唐书传。苏居中制胜。吴志传。周瑜除残去秽。葛洪曰。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112451-msxs34n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112451-msxs34n","updated":"20240611112451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女人病邪。雄黄松脂熔化。以虎爪搅之。夜烧取愈。苏恭曰。宕昌武都者佳。块方数寸。明彻如鸡冠。集简方。家有邪气者。雄黄水。以东南桃枝。咒洒满屋则绝迹。易林。家多怪祟。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112500-l5zn521","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112500-l5zn521"}},{"ID":"20240611112501-srj842d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112501-srj842d","updated":"20240611112505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112501-14xfpbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112501-14xfpbf","updated":"20240611112501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦平寒，有毒。主治寒热鼠 ，恶疮疽痔，死肌，杀精物恶鬼，邪气百虫毒，胜五兵，炼食之轻身，神仙。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112501-39a9efb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112501-39a9efb","updated":"20240611112501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（《别录》云∶雄黄出武都山谷， 煌山之阳。武都氏羌也，是为仇池，后名阶州，地接西戎界。宕昌亦有而稍劣。 煌在凉州西数千里。近来用石门谓之新坑，始兴石黄之好者耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112501-d0zdqek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112501-d0zdqek","updated":"20240611112501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阶州又出一种水窟雄黄，生于山岩中有水流处，其色深红而微紫，体极轻虚，功用最胜。抱朴子云∶雄黄当得武都山中出者纯而无杂，形块如丹砂，其赤如鸡冠，光明烨烨者，乃可用。有青黑色而坚者，名熏黄。有形色似真而气臭者，名臭黄，并不入服食，只可疗疮疥。金刚钻生于雄精之中，孕妇佩雄精，能转女成男。）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112501-0x6w5yq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112501-0x6w5yq","updated":"20240611112501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄色黄质坚，形如丹砂，光明烁烁，乃禀土金之气化，而散阴解毒之药也。水毒上行，则身寒热，而颈鼠 。雄黄禀土气而胜水毒，故能治之。肝血壅滞，则生恶疮而为疽痔，雄黄禀金气而平肝，故能治之。死肌乃肌肤不仁，精物恶鬼乃阴类之邪，雄黄禀火气而光明，故治死肌，杀精物恶鬼。邪气百虫之毒，逢土则解，雄黄色黄，故杀百虫毒。胜五兵者，一如硫黄能化金银铜铁锡也。五兵，五金也。胜五兵，火气盛也。炼而食之，则转刚为柔，金光内藏，故轻身神仙。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112510-blwygcd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112510-blwygcd"}},{"ID":"20240611112511-4kla69m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112511-4kla69m","updated":"20240611112515"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112511-ktqyui7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112511-ktqyui7","updated":"20240611112511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"重、解毒杀虫．"}]},{"ID":"20240611112511-q808vhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112511-q808vhk","updated":"20240611112511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛温有毒．独入厥阴气分．搜肝气而散肝风．杀百毒．辟鬼魅．治惊痫．痰涎积聚．头痛眩晕．暑疟 痢泄泻．（夷坚志云∶虞雍云∶道中冒暑、泄痢连月、梦至仙居、延之坐、壁中有词云∶暑毒在脾、湿气连脚、不泄则痢、不痢则疟、独炼雄黄、蒸饼和药、甘草作汤、食之安乐、别作治疗、医家大错、如方服之而愈．）又能化血为水．燥湿杀虫．治劳疳蛇伤．（焚之、蛇皆远去．）敷杨梅疔毒．疥癣痔疡．血虚者大忌．生山之阳．赤似鸡冠．明彻不臭．重三五两者良．醋浸．入莱菔汁煮干．生山之阴者．名雌黄．功用略同．劣者名熏黄．烧之则臭．只堪熏疮疥．杀虫虱．（阴肿如斗、雄黄矾石各二两、甘草一尺、水五升、煮二升、浸之．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112520-gs8ncch","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112520-gs8ncch"}},{"ID":"20240611112521-6v2n9n2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112521-6v2n9n2","updated":"20240611112527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112521-lnnq1hq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112521-lnnq1hq","updated":"20240611112521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禀阳精之气以生．驱阴破血．具辛热之功取效．入胃通肝．辟鬼除邪．化留聚痰涎之积．杀虫治疥．涂外伤虫虺之灾．（雄黄生山之阳．得阳精之气于地者也．以明如鸡冠．内无砂石者良．其石黄熏黄等．或产处不同．或变化不透．气味恶劣．只可杀虫搽疥．与雄黄有别耳．忌火 ．入肝胃．破瘀血．化痰涎．以其禀纯阳之气．故能辟鬼邪．杀蛇虺．解一切毒耳．）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112529-8mng98q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112529-8mng98q"}},{"ID":"20240611112535-xvzuuks","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112535-xvzuuks","updated":"20240611112539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112535-hv64gi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112535-hv64gi5","updated":"20240611112535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛苦温，微毒。武都者良。入香油熬化或米醋入萝卜汁煮干用，生则有毒伤人。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112535-u443elp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112535-u443elp","updated":"20240611112535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主寒热鼠 ，恶疮疽痔死肌，杀精物恶鬼邪气，百虫毒，胜五兵。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112535-kjbc6fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112535-kjbc6fd","updated":"20240611112535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄生山之阳，纯阳之精，入足阳明经。得阳气之正，能破阴邪、杀百虫、辟百邪，故《本经》所主皆阴邪浊恶之病。胜五兵者，功倍五毒之药也。其治惊痫痰涎及射工沙虱毒，与大蒜合捣涂之。同硝石煮服，立吐腹中毒虫。《千金方》治疔肿恶疮，先刺四边及中心，以雄黄末敷之。《圣惠方》治伤寒狐惑，以雄黄烧于瓶中，熏其下部。《和剂局方》酒症丸同蝎尾、巴豆治酒积痛。《肘后方》以雄黄矾石甘草汤煮，治阴肿如斗。《经验方》以雄黄、白芷为末酒煎，治破伤风肿。《家秘方》以雄黄研细，神曲糊为丸，空心酒下四五分，日服无间，专消疟母。《急救良方》以雄黄五钱、麝香二钱为末，作二服，酒下，治疯狗咬伤。《外台秘要》雄黄敷药箭毒。《摄生》妙用，雄黄、硫黄、绿豆粉，人乳调敷，酒鼻赤不过三五次愈。《痘疹证治》以雄黄一钱、紫草三钱为末，胭脂汁调，先以银簪挑破搽痘疔。《万氏方》治壅疡漫肿色不 赤，明雄黄细末三分，鸡子破壳调入饭上蒸熟食之，重者不过三枚即消。《圣济录》以雄黄、猪胆汁调敷白秃头疮。熏黄治恶疮疥癣，杀虫虱，和诸药熏嗽。《千金方》有咳嗽熏法。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112545-ookbzhv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112545-ookbzhv"}},{"ID":"20240611112546-fqw7f7y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112546-fqw7f7y","updated":"20240611112550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112546-ebv4qma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112546-ebv4qma","updated":"20240611112546"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛．入足阳明厥阴经．功专解毒胜邪．得黑铅治结阴．得朱砂猪心血治癫痫．雌黄主治略同．血虚者大忌．阴肿如斗．雄黄矾石各二两．甘草一尺．水五升．煮二升浸之良．"}]},{"ID":"20240611112407-fguxfaj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112407-fguxfaj"}},{"ID":"20240611112408-29mj8gx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112408-29mj8gx","updated":"20240611112412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112408-z5lq8gm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112408-z5lq8gm","updated":"20240611112408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味辛温，除痰辟邪，解毒杀虫。红透明彻者为雄黄；色黄暗晦者为雌黄。但能治疮虫，不堪入药。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112612-da9067n","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112612-da9067n"}},{"ID":"20240611112613-u1sowdn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112613-u1sowdn","updated":"20240611112619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112613-ot7n372","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112613-ot7n372","updated":"20240611112613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、甘，平，寒、大温，有毒。主寒热，鼠 ，恶疮，疽痔，死肌。疗疥石，KT疮，目痛，鼻中息肉，及绝筋，破骨，百节中大风，积聚，癖气，中恶，腹痛，鬼疰，杀精物，恶鬼，邪气，百虫，毒肿，胜五兵，杀诸蛇虺毒，解藜芦毒，悦泽人面。炼食之，轻身、神仙。饵服之，皆飞入人脑中，胜鬼神，延年益寿，保中不饥。得铜可作金。一名黄食石。生武都山谷、敦煌山之阳，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112613-nvl0uzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112613-nvl0uzn","updated":"20240611112613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炼服雄黄法，皆在《仙经》中，以铜为金，亦出《黄白术》中。晋末以来，氐羌中纷扰，此三、五两，其价如金。合丸皆用石门、始兴石黄之好者尔。始以齐初凉州平市微有所得，将至都下，余最先见于使人陈典签处，捡获见十余片，伊芳辈不识此物是何等，见有KT 挟雌黄，或谓是丹砂，五禾语并更属觅，于是渐渐而来，好者作鸡冠色，不臭而坚实。若点黑及虚软者不好也。武都、氐羌是为仇池。宕昌亦有，与仇池正同而小劣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112613-b32bz9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112613-b32bz9h","updated":"20240611112613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"敦煌在凉州西数千里，所出者未尝得来，江东不知，当复云何？此药最要，无所不入也。〔谨案〕出石门名石黄者，亦是雄黄，而通名黄食石。而石门者最为劣耳，宕昌、武都者为佳，块方数寸，明澈如鸡冠，或以为枕，服之辟恶。其青黑坚者，不入药用。若火烧飞之而精小，疗疮疥猥用亦无嫌。又云恶者名熏黄，用熏疗疮疥，故名之，无别熏黄也。贞观年中，以宕州新出，有得方数尺者，但重脆，不可全致之耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112625-f7irlwj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112625-f7irlwj"}},{"ID":"20240611112626-k03vwn2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112626-k03vwn2","updated":"20240611112631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112626-r3t127s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112626-r3t127s","updated":"20240611112626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、甘，平，寒、大温，有毒。主治寒热，鼠 ，恶疮，疽，痔，死肌。治疥虫，疮，目痛，鼻中息肉，及绝筋，破骨，百节中大风，积聚，癖气，中恶，腹痛，鬼疰，杀精物，恶鬼，邪气，百虫，毒肿，胜五兵，杀诸蛇虺毒，解藜芦毒，悦泽人面。炼食之，轻身，神仙。饵服之，皆飞入人脑中，胜鬼神，延年益寿，保中不饥。得铜可作金。一名黄食炼服雄黄法，皆在《仙经》中，以铜为金，亦出《黄白术》中。晋末以来，氐羌中纷扰，此物绝不复通，人间时有三、五两，其价如金。合丸皆用石门、始兴石黄之好者尔。始以齐初梁州互市微有所得，将至都下，余最先见于使人陈典签处，捡获见十余片，伊芳辈不识此物是何等，见有挟雌黄，或谓是丹砂，吾示语并更属觅，于是渐渐而来，好者作鸡冠色，不臭而坚实。若黯黑及虚软者不好也。武都、氐羌是为仇池。宕昌亦有，与仇池正同而小劣。敦煌在凉州西数千里，所出者未尝得来，江东不知，当复云何？此药最要，无所不入也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112556-yn7mt8k","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112556-yn7mt8k"}},{"ID":"20240611112557-xjbe9h3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112557-xjbe9h3","updated":"20240611112601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《本草简要方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112557-jypto0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112557-jypto0q","updated":"20240611112557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每三两以甘草紫背天葵地胆碧棱花各五两细锉。活水入坩锅中煮三伏时漉出。捣如粉。水飞。澄去黑者。晒干再研用。一法用米醋入萝卜汗煮干用。法制过。有毒不可用主治。伏暑泄痢。化腹中瘀血。治一切虫兽毒。制蛇虺尤特效。为治疮杀毒要药。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112557-yx47b3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112557-yx47b3b","updated":"20240611112557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄朱散。雄黄一分。（细研水飞过）乳香（细研）白矾（）各一钱。共研末。每服一字。二三岁儿五分。陈米汤下。日三次。治小儿下痢频仍。日夜痛不可忍。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112557-yrqit48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112557-yrqit48","updated":"20240611112557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄丸。雄黄全蝎牙皂大黄郁金各一钱。巴豆十四粒。麝香少许。共研末。米糊丸。绿豆大。清茶下五七丸。治疔疮大便秘或心腹痛。取利止。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112557-7253x14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112557-7253x14","updated":"20240611112557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄牡蛎散。雄黄二钱。牡蛎四钱研末。蜜调重汤炖温涂患处。日五六次。治天蛇毒初起红痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112557-zs7bsne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112557-zs7bsne","updated":"20240611112557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄散雄黄丹乳香没药各五钱。粟米小粉（炒）三两。草乌南星络石百合各一两。白芨二两。研末。温水调敷。治痈疽发背。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112557-emm33an","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112557-emm33an","updated":"20240611112557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又方。雄黄砂苍耳草（烧灰）研末醋调。另用菊花捣烂。姜汁调合为一。再调清者服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112557-y1w2bsb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112557-y1w2bsb","updated":"20240611112557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浓者敷之。治疔疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112557-i2n52ru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112557-i2n52ru","updated":"20240611112557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"红升丹。雄黄朱砂各五钱。水银二钱。火硝四两。白矾一两。皂矾六钱。先研矾硝入大铜杓内。火酒一小杯炖化。一干即起研细。汞朱黄各药亦研细。合并研匀。先以阳城罐用纸筋泥搪约一纸浓。阴干轻扑。不使生裂纹。裂则用泥补之。极干再晒无裂纹方入药。罐口以铁油盏盖定。加铁梁。盏上下用铁、铁丝扎紧。棉纸捻条蘸蜜周遭塞罐口缝间。外用熟石膏细末醋调封固。盏上加炭火两块。使盏热。罐口封固易干。用大钉三。钉地下。罐安钉上。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112557-bht60td","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112557-bht60td","updated":"20240611112557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"底置坚大炭火一块。外砌百眼炉。升三炷香。第一炷用底火。（火大则汞先飞上。）第二炷用大半罐火。以笔蘸水擦盏。第三炷火平罐口。用扇扇之。频频擦盏勿令干。（干则汞先飞上。）三香完。去火。冷定开看。盏上约有六七钱。刮下研极细。瓷罐盛用。（须预以盐卤调制罐稀泥用笔蘸调罐口。勿令泄气。如罐上有绿烟起。即汞走也。更须多刷出烟处令固。）治一切疮疡溃后。疮口坚硬。肉紫黑。能拔毒。去腐生肌。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112557-91kadr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112557-91kadr5","updated":"20240611112557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄苍术白芷蒜头烧烟熏。辟蛇虺毒虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112557-pikac4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112557-pikac4j","updated":"20240611112557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄烧酒调涂。治一切毒虫咬。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112557-j1ciqir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112557-j1ciqir","updated":"20240611112557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按色红晶明者为雄精。红者雄黄。黄者雌黄。质有良窳。非产地分阴阳也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112312-qkr4vub","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112312-qkr4vub"}},{"ID":"20240611112313-07eqs25","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-07eqs25","updated":"20240611112332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-j3i83dz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-j3i83dz","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出武都山者。（今阶州）纯而无杂。其赤如鸡冠。光明煜煜。乃可用。其但纯黄似雌黄。色无光者。不任作仙药。可合理病药耳。（抱朴子）雄黄生山之阳。生山阴者为雌黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-78enn30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-78enn30","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气温。味苦辛。有毒。（按性温而不热。何毒之有。若服食家伏火者则有毒。）气味俱浓。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-f2x7zbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-f2x7zbu","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"升也。阳也。入足阳明足厥阴经。秉火金之性。得正阳之气以生。察其功用。应是辛苦温之药。本经别录言甘寒者非也。本经主寒热鼠。恶疮疽痔死肌。杀精物恶鬼邪气百虫毒。诸本草治鼻中肉。及绝筋破骨。百节中大风。积聚癖气。中恶腹痛鬼疰。风邪癫痫岚瘴。一切虫兽毒。杀诸蛇虺毒。搜肝气。泻肝风。消痰积。治饮酒成癖。化腹中瘀血。杀劳虫疳虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-8upt0yx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-8upt0yx","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肝经气分。故肝风肝气。惊痫痰涎。及头痛眩晕。暑疟泄痢。积聚诸病。用之有殊功。又能化血为水。（濒湖）虞雍公暑痢。连月不瘥。忽梦至一处。见如仙官者延之坐。壁间有药方云。暑毒在脾。湿气连脚。不泄则痢。不痢则疟。独炼雄黄。蒸饼和药。别作治疗。医家大错。公依方用雄黄水飞九度。竹筒盛。蒸七次。研末。蒸饼和丸梧子大。每甘草汤下七丸。日三服愈。（夷坚志）周礼。疡医疗疡。以五毒攻之。康成注云。医方有五毒之药。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-dfr2nar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-dfr2nar","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"作之合黄。（即今有盖瓦合）置石胆丹砂雄黄矾石磁石其中。烧之三日夜。其烟上着。鸡羽扫取以注疮。恶肉破骨则尽出也。杨少时。疡生于颊。连齿辅车外。肿若覆瓯。溃出脓血。痛楚。百疗不瘥。依郑法烧药注之。少顷朽骨连牙溃出。其效若此。（颂）同红白药子白芨白蔹乳香没药冰片。敷一切肿痛痈疽。研末入猪胆内。套指头上。治天蛇疔毒发于中指。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-36acaue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-36acaue","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同金头蜈蚣牛角猪悬蹄皮象牙末黄蜡白矾。治通肠漏。同漆叶苦参刺蒺藜白芷荆芥天麻鳖虱胡麻半枝莲百部天冬。治大麻风眉毛脱落。偏头风痛。因肝风者。用雄黄细辛等分为末。每以一字吹鼻。左痛吹右。右痛吹左。此方用于寒冬及春寒未透之候更宜。胁下癖。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-aq41sjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-aq41sjk","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"及伤饮食。煮黄丸。用雄黄一两。巴豆五钱。同研。入白面二两。滴水为丸。梧子大。每服二十四丸。浆水煮三十沸。入冷浆水沉冷吞下。以利为度。如神。症瘕积聚。雄黄二两为末。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-7yh9413","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-7yh9413","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水飞九度。入新竹筒内。以蒸饼一块塞口。蒸七度。用好粉脂一两。和丸绿豆大。每服七丸。酒下。日三服。结阴便血。雄黄不拘多少。入枣内。线系定。煎汤。用铅一两化汁。倾入汤内同煮。自早至晚。不住添沸汤。取出为末。共枣杵和丸。梧子大。每服三十丸。煎黑铅汤空心下。只三服止。小儿痘疔。雄黄一钱。紫草三钱。为末。胭脂汁调。先以银簪挑破搽之。极妙。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-p3aw53n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-p3aw53n","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕丹方鉴源云。雄黄千年。化为黄金。别录云。山有金。金精重则生雌黄。若是则生山之阳者为雄。禀金之气也。生山之阴者为雌。孕金之精也。夫金禀中宫阴己之气。而其气却资始于阳。雄黄于金。虽未全其化气。然已赋其始气。缪氏所谓禀火金之性。得正阳之气以生。斯言中矣。正阳之义若何。曰。天一之壬水召丁。乃丙随于丁。而心以成。丙火召辛。庚又随于辛。而肺以成。然则人身之气。非火召金而金应火。以为正阳之气乎。雄黄适得阳气之正。而非其偏者。然正阳之气。又非离于阴者也。如丙之召辛。辛之归丙。本以一气相感应。此品得其气。而味始辛后苦。是固阴之归于阳也。其色如鸡冠。而明彻有光。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-ldd8tti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-ldd8tti","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又阳之化乎阴也。用以治疗诸疾。协于同气之阴阳。则相合而化以为理。值于戾气之阴阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-hb02u9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-hb02u9t","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即以其化而理者并化其戾。更化其戾而毒者矣。（修真家借以合丹。正为化阴以归阳。取其还于一也。非离阴以存阳。致其累于偏也。）观此味能散风毒。伤寒阴毒。伏暑毒。湿热毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-rbjifvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-rbjifvj","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛毒。积热毒。使非召阴以归。化阴以行。安能咸宜若是哉。然则海藏何止以搜肝风为言。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-mtom8hc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-mtom8hc","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曰。出地之风。乃元气之别使也。火之召金而布天气者。不能外于风木。金之从火而归地气者。亦不外于风木。故曰一阴为独使也。（雄黄疗肝风。其自阳召阴。是能治风淫。其由阳化阴。是能治风虚。但从其所主之剂何如耳。）如在下。水中之火有金。为一阴化原而使其上。在上。火中之水有金。又为一阴化原而使其下。能上则火金合而气布也。能下则水金合而血化也。是金之所媾。本不外木。木之所媾。本不离金。况庚之随辛者。还即召乙。如之何不专言肝乎。（方治如中风呕吐。鼻衄头痛。香港脚。破伤风癫痫。种种皆系于肝。又如痰饮喘症吐利。及胀满积聚胃脘之走气。癖瘀血及虫。或由气以病液。或由血以壅癖。皆不外于血脏之肝。）本经所主寒热鼠。恶疮疽痔。固皆戾气之病于血者。遇正阳之气而自化。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-5l708rs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-5l708rs","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即推之死肌鼻。暨绝筋破骨。亦因正阳之气以归真阴。所谓非其种者。自锄而去之矣。更若百虫蛇虺之必辟。固以气相制伏之理。至于能辟精物邪魅者。以精物邪魅。皆幽阴之气不化。如五行中禀正阳之气。则亦以阳明之气伏之矣。（如谵妄之太一备急散。太一神精丹。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112313-rsemhlu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112313-rsemhlu","updated":"20240611112313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"八毒赤丸。雄朱散。皆治尸疰等症。而用雄黄更专。可见此味果得阳气之正。能化幽阴邪气也。）〔辨治〕形块如丹砂。明彻不夹石者真。有青黑色而坚者名熏黄。形色似真而气臭者名臭黄。并不入服食。只可疗疮疥。其臭以醋洗之便去。最足乱真。宜辨。取透明色鲜红质嫩者。研如飞尘。水飞数次。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112152-8wozlt4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112152-8wozlt4"}},{"ID":"20240611112202-k0hnl4g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-k0hnl4g","updated":"20240611112308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-uoev8f3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-uoev8f3","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】本品为含硫化砷的矿物。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-qyogyrn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-qyogyrn","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】辛，温。有毒。入肝、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-5wym06p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-5wym06p","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】解毒，杀虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-g91pa6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-g91pa6a","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1.用于痈疮肿毒、虫蛇咬伤等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-vyesrlo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-vyesrlo","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄能疗疮毒，如疗疮肿毒，可配合螺酥、朱砂等药用于外敷，或制成丸剂内服。如虫蛇所伤，可配合五灵脂，研成细末，外敷，或制成蛇药内服，以奏解毒之效。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-qv6tv94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-qv6tv94","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.用于虫积腹痛、疥癣等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-zo0m9er","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-zo0m9er","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄能毒杀蛔虫等一些肠寄生虫，内服可作驱虫药，一般配合苦楝根皮、摈榔、牵牛子、大黄等同用。对疥癣，本品可以配轻粉、大风子等外搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-26xrmfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-26xrmfj","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，雄黄又可合常山等药用治疟疾。另有用本品与艾叶、苍朮、白芷等药作烟熏剂，可作房舍、畜厩的消毒剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-iywin3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-iywin3a","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】雄黄、雄精、腰黄（生用，内服，须飞边用。本品不宜用火炮制）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-vll9w50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-vll9w50","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】外用适量。内服每次五厘至一分。一般入丸散，不入汤剂；且不能持续服用，以免蓄积中毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-ahj2ljb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-ahj2ljb","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】红灵丹（验方）：雄黄、麝香、朱砂、青礞石、银硝、硼砂、冰片治中暑，发痧，头晕胸闷，腹病吐泻。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-h8pdq7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-h8pdq7p","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【文献摘录】《本经》：「主寒热鼠痿恶疮，疽痔死肌，杀百虫毒。」"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-3bszud4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-3bszud4","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《别录》：「疗疥虫匿疮，目痛，鼻中息肉。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-x2bi45o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-x2bi45o","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《大明本草》：「主疥癣，风邪癫痫，岚障，一切虫兽伤。」"}]},{"ID":"20240611112202-wo3w6kv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112202-wo3w6kv","updated":"20240611112202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草纲目》：「治疟疾寒热，伏署泄痢，酒饮成瘫，惊滴，头风弦晕。」"}]},{"ID":"20240611112129-ggwqiy7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112129-ggwqiy7"}},{"ID":"20240611112145-kcuweg9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-kcuweg9","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：雄黄"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-y6ms5nb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-y6ms5nb","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-8el936y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-8el936y","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Xiónɡ Huánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-idkpm7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-idkpm7n","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-pwbhenk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-pwbhenk","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 明雄黄、黄金石、石黄"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ji5qe11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ji5qe11","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-s041i67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-s041i67","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" REALGAR"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-26difgg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-26difgg","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-jf0504g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-jf0504g","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为硫化物类矿物雄黄族"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"雄黄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，主含二硫化二砷（As2S2）。采挖后，除去杂质。或由低品位矿石浮选生产的精矿粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-i06pf03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-i06pf03","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-a5qw9r2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-a5qw9r2","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为块状或粒状集合体，呈不规则块状。深红色或橙红色，条痕淡橘红色，晶面有金刚石样光泽。质脆，易碎，断面具树脂样光泽。微有特异的臭气，味淡。精矿粉为粉末状或粉末集合体，质松脆，手捏即成粉，橙黄色，无光泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-decv3bu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-decv3bu","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-lh3darp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-lh3darp","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置干燥处，密闭。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-z18v4ir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-z18v4ir","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-3m1jf0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-3m1jf0v","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 雄黄粉：取雄黄照水飞法（附录Ⅱ D）水飞，晾干。取粉末适量，照上述三氧化二砷检查项下的方法检查，应符合规定。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-0zm6jdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-0zm6jdf","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-w4nubib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-w4nubib","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）取本品粉末10mg，加水润湿后，加氯酸钾饱和的硝酸溶液2ml,溶解后，加氯化钡试液，生成大量白色沉淀。放置后，倾出上层酸液，再加水2ml,振摇，沉淀不溶解。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-wrhjt2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-wrhjt2f","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末0.2g，置坩埚内，加热熔融，产生白色或黄白色火焰，伴有白色浓烟。取玻片覆盖后，有白色冷凝物，刮取少量，置试管内加水煮沸使溶解，必要时滤过，溶液加硫化氢试液数滴，即显黄色，加稀盐酸后生成黄色絮状沉淀，再加碳酸铵试液，沉淀复溶解。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-b23upwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-b23upwb","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"含量测定"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ecavvza","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ecavvza","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取本品粉末约0.1g，精密称定，置250ml 锥形瓶中，加硫酸钾1g、硫酸铵2g与硫酸8ml,用直火加热至溶液澄明，放冷，缓缓加水50ml，加热微沸3～5分钟，放冷，加酚酞指示液2 滴，用氢氧化钠溶液（40→100） 中和至显微红色，放冷，用0.25mol/L硫酸溶液中和至褪色，加碳酸氢钠5g，摇匀后，用碘滴定液（0.1mol/L）滴定，至近终点时，加淀粉指示液2ml,滴定至溶液显紫蓝色。每1ml 的碘滴定液（0.1mol/L）相当于5.348mg 的二硫化二砷（As2S2）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-yn0bo2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-yn0bo2u","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品含砷量以二硫化二砷（As2S2）计，不得少于90.0％。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ccezjek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ccezjek","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-a0fldwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-a0fldwm","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ud1ejyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ud1ejyp","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-xyz4d55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-xyz4d55","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，温；有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-qvdy3uu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-qvdy3uu","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-0hgs4at","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-0hgs4at","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服宜慎；不可久用；孕妇禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ayob3ki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ayob3ki","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-s9kp4x7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-s9kp4x7","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解毒杀虫，燥湿祛痰，截疟。用于痈肿疔疮，蛇虫咬伤，虫积腹痛，惊痫，疟疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ktz236t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ktz236t","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-80rnx40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-80rnx40","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 0.05～0.1g，入丸散用。外用适量，熏涂患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-q2m4njg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-q2m4njg","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-omo0or6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-omo0or6","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-q3rlahe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-q3rlahe","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：雄黄"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-8607pnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-8607pnj","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-4yd6vai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-4yd6vai","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Xiónɡ Huánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-h5sqs61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-h5sqs61","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-v0upt2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-v0upt2h","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 黄金石（《本经》），石黄（《唐本草》），天阳石（《石药尔雅》），黄石（《品汇精要》），鸡冠石（《石雅》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-9t65sfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-9t65sfn","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-afawcmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-afawcmu","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-8yj1luv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-8yj1luv","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-bnu5sj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-bnu5sj2","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为硫化物类矿物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"雄黄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的矿石。雄黄在矿中质软如泥，见空气即变坚硬，一般用竹刀剔取其熟透部分，除去杂质泥土。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-b98r32u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-b98r32u","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-sk7w88h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-sk7w88h","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 产湖南、湖北、贵州、云南、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-58xisuc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-58xisuc","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-egf7hs3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-egf7hs3","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 单斜晶系。晶体柱状，晶面上有纵行条纹，大多成致密块状或粒状集合体。颜色为橘红色，少数为暗红色。条痕淡橘红色。晶面具金刚光泽，断面呈树脂光泽。半透明。解理较完全。断口贝壳状。硬度1.5～2.0。比重3.4～3.6。性脆。受光的作用，久则变为谈橘红色粉末。产于低温热液矿脉内，温泉及火山附近也有存在。常与雄黄、辉锑矿等共生。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-mc295cn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-mc295cn","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-bqlf7xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-bqlf7xr","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为不规则的坎状，大小不一。全体呈深红色或橘红色，表面常覆有橙黄色粉末。体重，质松易碎，断面粗糙，红色，明亮。微有特异的臭气。其中颜色鲜艳、半透明、有光泽者习称\"明雄\"、\"雄精\"或\"腰黄\"。以色红、块大、质松、无石性者为佳。不溶于水及盐酸；可溶于硝酸，溶液成黄色；溶于氢氧化钠溶液中呈棕色。燃之易熔融成红紫色液体，并生黄白色烟，有强烈的蒜臭气；冷却后熔融物凝成红紫色固体，质纯者凝成橘红色固体。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-azcfuw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-azcfuw6","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雌黄与雄黄的性状比较相似，但雌黄为黄色，雄黄则呈红色或橘红色，可以区别。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-cktcd6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-cktcd6x","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-odm3ecs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-odm3ecs","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主为硫化砷AsS，并含少量其他重金属盐。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-y1a2gxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-y1a2gxu","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-p9zapyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-p9zapyy","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①抗菌作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-khcuqi4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-khcuqi4","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雄黄水浸剂（1：2）在试管内对多种皮肤真菌有不同程度的抑制作用。其1/100的浓度于黄豆固体培养基上试验，对人型、牛型结核杆菌及耻垢杆菌有抑制生长的作用。用菖蒲、艾叶、雄黄合剂烟熏2～4小时以上，对金黄色葡萄球菌、变形杆菌、绿脓杆菌均有杀菌作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-26t010n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-26t010n","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②抗血吸虫作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-97a7fi2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-97a7fi2","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"感染日本血吸虫尾蚴的小鼠，于感染前3天开始给雄黄、槟榔、阿魏、肉桂合剂0.2毫升/20克，感染后继续给药12天，成虫减少率达75.27％，动物无虫率达14.29％，无雌虫率达42.86％。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-t84vf31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-t84vf31","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-98tm1cf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-98tm1cf","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 碾成极细粉。残水飞，晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-d953pfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-d953pfy","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《纲目》：\"（雄黄）用米醋入萝卜汁煮干用良。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-o398eli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-o398eli","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-b2y2se3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-b2y2se3","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入心、肝、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-0ge5apk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-0ge5apk","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"入肝经气分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-g2j8o51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-g2j8o51","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"入足阳明经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-uzvkuel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-uzvkuel","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草再新》：\"入心、肝二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-mvhux2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-mvhux2d","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ryv48yc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ryv48yc","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛苦，温，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-lu54b3s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-lu54b3s","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味苦，平寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-7tfn622","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-7tfn622","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"甘，大温，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-tnfk7r4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-tnfk7r4","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"味辛。有大毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-zypr8ve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-zypr8ve","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"微毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-6niisqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-6niisqi","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-lhzo07m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-lhzo07m","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 阴亏血虚及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-4ik3yt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-4ik3yt9","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草通玄》：\"血虚大忌用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-1127drd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-1127drd","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-7gz6z1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-7gz6z1p","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 燥湿，祛风，杀虫，解毒。治疥癣，秃疮，痈疽，走马牙疳，缠腰蛇丹，破伤风，蛇虫蟹伤，腋臭，臁疮，哮喘，喉痹，惊痫，痔瘘。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ac2jmlc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ac2jmlc","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主寒热，鼠瘘，恶疮，疽痔，死肌，杀百虫毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-tcyda86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-tcyda86","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗疥虫，匿疮，目痛，鼻中息肉及绝筋破骨。百节中大风，积聚，癖气，中恶腹痛，杀诸蛇虺毒，解藜芦毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-zst6oe5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-zst6oe5","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》：\"治疥癣，风邪，癫痫，岚瘴，一切蛇虫犬兽咬伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-b4rikag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-b4rikag","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④王好古：\"搜肝气，泻肝风，消涎积。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-7hje1bg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-7hje1bg","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《纲目》：\"治疟疾寒热，伏暑泄痢，酒饮成癖，惊痫，头风眩晕，化腹中瘀血，杀劳虫疳虫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-jiyecfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-jiyecfc","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草正》：\"治痈疽腐肉，并鼠痿，疽、痔等毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-28ca2sc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-28ca2sc","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ajrm0lg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ajrm0lg","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用：研末撒、调敷或烧烟熏。内服：入丸、散，1～4分。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ax5go8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ax5go8k","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-u0sckqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-u0sckqg","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治瘑疥：雄黄一两，黄连二两，松脂三两，发灰如弹丸。四物熔猪膏与松脂合，热捣，以薄疮上。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-zab9j9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-zab9j9f","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治癣：雄黄粉，大酢和。先以新布拭之，令癣伤，敷之。（《千金翼方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-rkyfhoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-rkyfhoa","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治遍身虫疥虫癣：雄黄、蛇床子各等分，俱研细，水银减半。以猪油和捣匀，入水银再研，以不见星为度。早晚以汤洗净，搽药。（《姜月峰家传方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-b2gltk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-b2gltk2","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治白秃头疮：雄黄、猪胆汁。和敷之。（《圣济总录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-oipqvl1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-oipqvl1","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治痈疽坏烂及诸疮发毒：雄黄五钱，滑石倍用。上为末，洗后掺疮上，外用绵子覆盖相护。凡洗后破烂者，用此贴之。（《世医得效方》生肉神异膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-zswf21b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-zswf21b","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治对口疼痛：雄黄一钱，吴茱萸一两。为末，香油熬熟调搽。（《经验广集》雄吴散）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-8x2z9tw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-8x2z9tw","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治疔肿：针刺四边及中心，涂雄黄末。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-qgj4gn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-qgj4gn6","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治走马牙府，臭烂出血：雄黄豆大七粒。每粒以淮枣去核包之，铁线串于灯上烧化为末。每以少许掺之，去涎，以愈为度。（《全幼心鉴》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-gxh2yhb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-gxh2yhb","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治蛇缠疮：雄黄为末，醋调徐，仍用酒服。凡为蛇伤及蜂虿、蜈蚣、毒虫、颠犬所伤，皆可用。（《世医得效方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-wy1xfsz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-wy1xfsz","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治破伤风：雄黄一钱，防风二钱，草乌一钱。上为细末，每服-字，温酒调下。里和至愈可服，里不和不可服。（《素同病机保命集》发表雄黄散）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-twwels7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-twwels7","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治蛇咬伤：雄黄一两，生五灵脂一两。共研细末，分成十包，每二小时服一包，每日四至八次，开水送下，另取雄黄二两，研细末，用香油一两调匀，涂于患处，每日更换2～3次。（《山东医刊》（4）：23，1963）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-jkv6mss","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-jkv6mss","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治腋臭：雄黄、石膏各半斤，白矾一斤。石膏研末，放锅内煅成白色，再将雄黄、白矾研细过筛，混合搅匀，密闭保存。用时将手指沾水湿润后，沾适量药粉（约一钱），使成浆糊状（勿过稠或过稀），涂于腋窝部，每日一次，连续涂药至愈。（《全展选编·皮肤疾病》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-m4fdvcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-m4fdvcr","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治臁疮日久：雄黄二钱。陈皮五钱。青布卷作大捻，烧烟熏之。（《卫生杂兴》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-9w50hij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-9w50hij","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治杨梅疮：雄黄一钱半，杏仁三十粒（去皮），轻粉一钱。为末，洗净，以雄猪胆汁调上。（《积德堂经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-6p3qyc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-6p3qyc6","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治赤鼻：雄黄五钱（用透明成块、无石、红色者为佳），硫黄五钱，陈水粉（真正者）。共研细末，合一处，用乳汁调敷。（《摄生众妙方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-k5yzo3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-k5yzo3b","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃治大麻疯：真漆一两（入蟹黄五钱拌匀，晒之，渐渐去浮面上水），明雄黄、牙皂各五钱。和匀为丸，不可见日，阴干。每服三分，酒下。（《疡医大全》雄漆丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-z2oerzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-z2oerzc","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒄治伤寒狐惑，毒蚀下部，肛门如匿，痛痒不止.雄黄半两。先用瓶子一个，口稍大者，内入灰上（土），如装香火，将雄黄烧之，候烟出，以瓶口当病处熏之。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-7sofpwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-7sofpwq","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒅治缠喉急喉风，双蛾肿痛，汤药难下：雄黄一两，巴豆（去油）十四个，郁金一钱。为末，醋糊丸如绿豆大。茶清下七丸，吐出顽痰即苏。如口噤，以物斡开灌之。（《丹溪心法》雄黄解毒丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-6cko0hv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-6cko0hv","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒆治小儿诸痫：雄黄、朱砂等分。为末，每取一钱，猪心血入虀水调。（《仁斋直指方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-fwz3eob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-fwz3eob","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒇治癫痫卒倒，常愈常发：雄黄（水飞过）、胆星（俱研细）、萆麻内务等分。共研匀，米糊为丸，如绿豆大。每早饭后服一钱，白汤下。（《方脉正宗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ynvwt05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ynvwt05","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（21）治偏头疼：雄黄、细辛等分。研令细。每用一字已下，左边疼吹入右鼻，右边疼吹入左鼻。（《博济方》至灵散）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-evk6tou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-evk6tou","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（22）治腹胁痞块：雄黄一两，白矾一两。为末，面糊调膏摊贴。（《集玄方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-7vgt7qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-7vgt7qw","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（23）治痔疮并肠红：雄黄一钱五分，五倍子一两，白矾二钱。共研末，乌梅肉为丸。每服一钱，空心白汤下。（《医方易简》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-j4ad7a7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-j4ad7a7","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（24）治积年冷痿，出黄水不瘥：雄黄半两（细研），清油三两，乱发半两，硫黄半两（细研），黄蜡半两。上先以油煎乱发令焦尽，去滓，便入雄黄、硫黄及黄蜡，以慢火熬搅成膏，摊帛上贴之。（《圣惠方》雄黄膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-43zbivl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-43zbivl","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（25）治布鲁氏菌痢病后遗症：雄黄一两，大蒜六十瓣。将雄黄研细，大蒜捣烂，配制成六十丸，每次一丸，一日三次。连服二十天为一疗程。（《全展选编·传染病》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-selk4b2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-selk4b2","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-c1pdgub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-c1pdgub","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疗慢性支气管炎及支气管哮喘"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-usnfaqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-usnfaqv","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取明雄黄500克，白糊为丸1000粒。成人每服1丸，10～15岁每服1/2丸，5～9岁每服1/3，2～4岁每服1/4丸，每日3次，温开水送服。治疗慢性气管炎39例（其中喘息性支气管炎19例）、支气管哮喘11例，效果：治愈（症状消失未再发）16例,显着好转（症状消失,但感冒或劳累过度时仍有轻微症状）14例,症状减轻9例，无效6例（均合并肺气肿\\支气管扩张），因效果不明显中断治疗6人。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-lqw8yx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-lqw8yx0","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗热带性嗜伊红细胞增多症 雄黄中含有三硫化二砷，用以试治本病1例，结果取得明显效果。用量：每次4分，日服2次。服后4天气促、咳嗽均减轻，肺部罗音消失，血检白细胞由18300/立方毫米降为8400／立方毫米，嗜伊红细胞由63％降为24％，X线胸片复查与治疗前对比有明显吸收，自觉症状消失出院。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ueumjid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ueumjid","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疗带状疱疹"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ptwaukb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ptwaukb","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取雄黄粉50克，加入75％酒精100毫升混合。每天搽敷2次，如疼痛剧烈，可在雄黄酊中加入2％普鲁卡因20毫升。治疗125例，皆有效。疗程平均为5.8天。无副作用及后遗症。另有用雄黄5克，冰片0.5克，酒精100毫升搽患部，每日4～6次，治疗10例，一般再在搽药1～2后疼痛减轻，水泡萎缩，红肿逐渐消退，以后自行脱皮而愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-47t0ozp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-47t0ozp","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治疗翼状胬肉"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-pk3iodb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-pk3iodb","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取雄黄3分，生矾1钱，；共研细粉末装入有色瓶内，置阴凉处备用。患者取仰卧位，先作眼科常规麻醉及消毒。用开睑器撑开眼睑，嘱患者斜视健侧，使胬肉充分暴露，以消毒小棉棒蘸取少量药粉，涂于胬肉表面，待1～2分钟（过长无效）用有齿小镊子将胬肉头部挟起，逆胬肉伸展方向揭扯，待撕至半月皱襞处，用无菌小剪从胬肉根部剪下，再在根部涂少量药粉，待渗血停止，将残留之胬肉提净，并将多余之药粉加以清除，敷以眼药膏，外加包扎，次日揭去敷料，点眼药水数天即愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-9xvcrq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-9xvcrq8","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治疗破伤风"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-jsd48p8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-jsd48p8","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用雄黄粉5钱，豆腐0.5斤（为成人1日量），儿童酌减。法将豆腐中心挖一孔，雄黄填于孔内，用挖出之豆腐覆盖，水煮1小时。待痉挛停止时将豆腐连汤分3次服下，连服5天，曾治2例，均愈。但由于病例尚少，需继续在实践中验证。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-epdv8b6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-epdv8b6","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治疗流行性腮腺炎"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-zzdh7rp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-zzdh7rp","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用雄黄45克，明矾60克，冰片3～5克，共研细末，装入有色瓶中密闭备用。每次取3～5克置小杯中，酌加75％酒精调成糊壮，涂于局部。日涂2～3次。治疗16例（腮腺高度肿胀，体温在38℃左右），1～2天后即明显消肿，体温恢复正常，第3天症状完全消失。较对症治疗组（计20例，疗程为5～15天）疗程明显缩短。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-1wmg9vl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-1wmg9vl","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦中毒与解毒"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ut7hwvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ut7hwvv","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾报告内服含砒雄黄急性中毒致死1例，中毒主要症状为上吐下泻。市售雄黄含砒霜，药用时应注意选择，以红黄色状如鸡冠者质较纯粹，如为白色结晶或碾碎时外红中白者，均为含有砒霜之征，用时需特别慎重。中毒后之急救方法，可用防己3钱；或生甘草1份，绿豆2份，煎浓汁频服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-throrc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-throrc6","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-06b16oe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-06b16oe","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"雄黄，乃治疮杀毒要药也，而入肝经气分，故肝风，肝气，惊痫，痰涎头痛眩晕，暑疟泄痢，积聚诸病，用之有殊功；又能化血为水。而方士乃炼治服饵，神异其说，被其毒者多矣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ogx1bpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ogx1bpf","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"雄黄，味苦平，气寒有毒，《别录》加甘、大温，甄权言辛、大毒，察其功用，应是辛苦温之药，而甘则非也。其主寒热，鼠瘘，恶疮，疽痔，死肌，疥虫，匿疮诸证，皆湿热留滞肌肉所致，久则浸淫而生虫，此药苦辛，能燥湿杀虫，故为疮家要药。其主鼻中息肉者，肺气结也，癖气者，大肠积滞也，筋骨断绝者，气血不续也，辛能散结滞，温能通行气血，辛温相合而杀虫，故能搜剔百节中大风积聚也。雄黄性热有毒，外用亦见其所长，内服难免其无害，凡在服饵，中病乃已，毋尽剂也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-b4jdtz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-b4jdtz6","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-epgqhmv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-epgqhmv","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-0ovou2q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-0ovou2q","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：雄黄"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-mew79s7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-mew79s7","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-4jii3i5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-4jii3i5","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Xiónɡ Huánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-3mg21lx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-3mg21lx","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ib9go52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ib9go52","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 黄食石、熏黄、黄金石、石黄、天阳石、黄石、鸡冠石"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-mcrgfu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-mcrgfu4","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-u5sajty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-u5sajty","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Realgar"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-49z07u1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-49z07u1","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-tfpxlcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-tfpxlcm","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-jy7tx0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-jy7tx0d","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《名医别录》：雄黄，生武都山谷，煌山之阳，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-1xk3oza","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-1xk3oza","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611112145-81ae6fc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-81ae6fc","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611112145-42kjwak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-42kjwak","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶弘景：(雄黄)好者作鸡冠色，不臭而坚实。若黯黑及虚软者不好也。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-pclok53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-pclok53","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《唐本草》：出石门名石黄者亦是雄黄，而通名黄金石。石门者最为劣尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-63svdg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-63svdg8","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《日华子本草》：雄黄，通赤亮者为上，验之可以虫死者为真，臭气少，细嚼口中含汤不激辣者通用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-vu5c78p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-vu5c78p","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草图经》：雄黄，今阶州山中有之。形块如丹砂，"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-9p061gk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-9p061gk","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-e7cperu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-e7cperu","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为硫化物类矿物雄黄的矿石。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-35vyvk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-35vyvk6","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Realgar"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-jjv4gcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-jjv4gcz","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：雄黄在矿中质软如泥，见空气即变坚硬，一般用竹刀剔取其熟透部分，除去杂质泥土。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-8bxfr2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-8bxfr2s","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ca20uxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ca20uxu","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：雄黄主要为低温热液、火山热液矿床中的典型矿物，与雌黄紧密共生。还见于温泉沉积和硫质喷气孔的沉积物里。偶尔发现于煤层和褐铁矿层中，为有机质分解所产生的硫化氢与含砷溶液作用的产物。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-mf39nfh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-mf39nfh","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：主产于甘肃、湖北、湖南、四川、贵州、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-v37kl2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-v37kl2x","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-8q00he4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-8q00he4","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 晶体结构属单斜晶系。晶体细小，呈柱状、短柱状或针状，但较少见。通常多呈粒状，致密块状，有时呈土状、粉末状、皮壳状集合体。橘红色，表面或有暗黑及灰色的锖色。条痕浅橘红色。晶体呈金刚光泽，断口树脂光泽。硬度1.5-2，相对密度3.56，阳光久照会发生破坏而转变为淡橘红色粉末。锤击之有刺鼻蒜臭。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-f88bm9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-f88bm9d","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-04d4dhb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-04d4dhb","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 本品为块状或粒状集合体，多呈不规则块状。深红色或橙红色，表面常附有橙黄色细粉，手触之染指；条痕橙色。微透明或半透明，晶面具金刚光泽。质较酥脆，易砸碎，断面红色至深红色，具树脂样光泽。微有特异臭气，味淡（有毒）。精矿粉为粉末状或粉末集合体，质松脆，手捏即成粉，橙黄色，无光泽。以块大、色红、质酥脆、有光泽、无杂石者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-91ptwij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-91ptwij","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 反射偏光镜下：反射色为灰色，微带紫色；内反射橙色；偏旋旋旋旋光性清楚；反射率20%(伏黄)。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-avggy3z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-avggy3z","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"透射偏光镜下：多色性明显，Ng＝Nm，淡金黄色或朱红色，Np几乎无色至浅橙黄色；干涉色橙红色；斜消光，消光角C∧Np=11°。二轴晶；负光性。折射率Ng＝2.704，Nm＝2.648，Np＝2.538；双折射率Ng－Np＝0.166。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-5etevn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-5etevn2","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"品质标志 (1)《中华人民共和国药典》1995年版规定：本品含砷量以二硫化二砷(As2Ss)计算，不得少于90.0%。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-70v0whw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-70v0whw","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）杂质检查 三氧化二砷：取本品适量，研细，精密称取0.94g,加稀盐酸20ml,不断搅拌30min,滤过，残渣用稀盐酸洗涤2次，每次10ml，搅拌10min。洗液与滤液合并，置500ml量瓶中，加水至刻度，摇匀，精密量取10ml，置100ml量瓶中，加水稀释至刻度，摇匀，精密量取2ml，加盐酸5ml与水21ml，照砷盐检查法(《中华人民共和国药典》1995年版附录)检查，所显砷斑颜色不得深于标准砷斑。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-34391me","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-34391me","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"商品规格 商品常分为雄黄、明雄、烧雄等规格。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-98h17yg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-98h17yg","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）雄黄 呈块状或粉末状；深红色或橙红色；块状者又名苏雄黄，有光泽，粉末状者，质疏松易碎。药用较广。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-taqddt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-taqddt7","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）明雄 又名雄精，多呈块状，鲜红色，半透明，经加工成椭圆形，多随身佩带，作装饰品，故又名腰黄。过去有的加工成杯状，称为雄黄杯。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-j6wobvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-j6wobvy","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）烧雄 为雄黄提炼加工品。呈块状，色紫红；无光泽；条痕黄色，质较硬脆，易砸碎，断面胶质状，不呈结晶性，常具细砂孔，微有硫黄气味。主产贵州。含二硫化二砷(As2S2)低于雄黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-m730tvp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-m730tvp","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-p9bg2tc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-p9bg2tc","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 雄黄主要含有二硫化二砷(As2S2)，并含有硅、铅、铁、钙、镁等杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-nsr6nqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-nsr6nqp","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-9dae0ct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-9dae0ct","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.抗菌作用：雄黄水浸剂(1∶2)在试管内对多种皮肤真菌有不同程度的抑制作用，其 1／100的浓度于黄豆固体培养基上试验，对人型、牛型结核秆菌及耻垢杆菌有抑制生长的作用。用菖蒲、艾叶、雄黄合剂烟熏2-4小时以上，对金黄色葡萄球菌、变形杆菌、绿脓杆菌均有杀菌作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-3u87nb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-3u87nb3","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抗血吸虫作用：感染日本血吸虫尾蚴的小鼠，于感染前3天开始给雄黄、槟榔、阿魏、肉桂合剂0.2ml／20g，感染后继续给药12天，成虫减少率达75.27%，动物无虫率达14.29%，无雌虫率达42.86%。雄黄有杀菌作用。雄黄1：2的水浸液在试管内对堇色毛癣菌等皮肤真菌有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-o8xaxu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-o8xaxu4","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-pvoqcsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-pvoqcsw","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 碾成极细粉，或水飞，晾干。《纲目》：(雄黄)用米醋入萝卜汁煮干用良。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-1b8aqz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-1b8aqz8","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ftu0rmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ftu0rmo","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (1)取本品粉末0.1g，加水湿润后，加氯酸钾饱和的硝酸溶液2ml，溶解后，加氯化钡试液，生成大量白色沉淀。放置后，倾取上层酸液，再加水2ml，振摇，沉淀不溶解。(检查硫酸盐)(2)取本品粉末0.2g，置坩埚中内，加热熔融，产生白色或黄白色火焰，伴有白色浓烟。取玻片覆盖后，有白色冷凝物，刮取少量，置试管内加水煮沸使溶解，必要时过滤，溶液加硫化氢试液数滴，即显黄色，加稀盐酸后生成黄色絮状沉淀，再加碳酸胺试液，沉淀复溶解。（检查砷盐）"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-htzcubj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-htzcubj","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-4bgv0sf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-4bgv0sf","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 心；肝；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-zqgpjbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-zqgpjbq","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-b1yrgpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-b1yrgpa","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛；苦；温；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ovq8d2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ovq8d2k","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-l4zkefh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-l4zkefh","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 阴亏血虚及孕妇忌服。《本草通玄》：血虚大忌用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-unznbvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-unznbvx","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-uc6wtgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-uc6wtgo","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 燥湿；祛痰；杀虫；解毒。主痈疽疔疮；走马牙疳；喉风喉痹；疥癣；缠腰火丹；湿毒疮；痔疮；蛇虫咬伤；虫积；惊痫；疟疾；哮喘"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-xk9bl77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-xk9bl77","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-d6xejfv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-d6xejfv","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用：研末撒、调敷或烧烟熏。内服：入丸、散，1-4分。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-hyxaliz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-hyxaliz","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-vmco08e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-vmco08e","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治滴疥： 雄黄一两，黄连二两，松脂三两，发灰如弹丸。四物熔猪膏与松脂合，热捣，以薄疮上。(《补缺肘后方》)②治癣： 雄黄粉，大酢和。先以新布拭之，令癣伤，敷之。(《千金翼方》)③治遍身虫疥虫癣： 雄黄、蛇床子各等分，俱研细，水银减半。以猪油和捣匀，入水银再研，以不见星为度。早晚以汤洗净，搽药。(《姜月峰家传方》)④治白秃头疮：雄黄、猪胆汁。和敷之。(《圣济总录》)⑤治痈疽坏烂及诸疮发毒： 雄黄五钱，滑石倍用。上为末，洗后掺疮上，外用绵子覆盖相护。凡洗后破烂者，用此贴之。(《世医得效方》生肉神异膏)⑥治对口疼痛： 雄黄一钱，吴茱萸一两。为末，香油熬熟调搽。(《经验广集》雄吴散)⑦治疗肿： 针刺四边及中心，涂雄黄末。(《千金方》)⑧治走马牙疳，臭烂出血： 雄黄豆大七粒。每粒以淮枣去核包之，铁线串于灯上烧化为末。每以少许掺之，去涎，以愈为度。(《全幼心鉴》)⑨治蛇缠疮： 雄黄为末，醋调涂，仍用酒服。凡为蛇伤及蜂虿、蜈蚣、毒虫、颠犬所伤，皆可用。(《世医得效方》)⑩治破伤风： 雄黄一钱， 防风二钱，草乌一钱。上为细末，每服一字，温酒调下。里和至愈可服，里不和不可服。(《素问病机保命集》发表雄黄散)(11)治蛇咬伤： 雄黄一两，生五灵脂一两。共研细末，分成十包，每二小时服一包，每日四至八次，开水送下。另取雄黄二两，研细末，用香油一两调匀，涂于患处，每日更换2～3次。 〔《山东医刊》(4)：23，1963〕(12)治腋臭： 雄黄、石膏各半斤，白矾一斤。石膏研末，放锅内煅成白色，再将雄黄、白矾研细过筛，混合搅匀，密闭保存。用时将手指沾水湿润后，沾适量药粉(约一钱)，使成浆糊状(勿过稠或过稀)，涂于腋窝部，每日一次，连续涂药至愈。(《全展选编·皮肤疾病》)(13)治臁疮日久：雄黄二钱，陈皮五钱。青布卷作大拈，烧烟熏之。 (《卫生杂兴》) (14)治杨梅疮： 雄黄一钱半，杏仁三十粒(去皮)，轻粉一钱。为末，洗净，以雄猪胆汁调上。(《积德堂经验方》)(15)治赤鼻： 雄黄五钱(用透明成块、无石、红色者为佳)，硫黄五钱，陈水粉(真正者)。共研细末，合一处，用乳汁调敷。(《摄生众妙方》)(16)治大麻疯： 真漆一两(入蟹黄五钱拌匀，晒之，渐渐去浮面上水)，明雄黄、牙皂各五钱。和匀为丸，不可见日，阴干。每服三分，酒下。(《疡医大全》雄漆丸)(17)治伤寒狐惑，毒蚀下部，痛痒不止： 雄黄半两。先用瓶子一个，口稍大者，内入灰上(土)，如装香火，将雄黄烧之，候烟出，以瓶口当病处熏之。(《圣惠方》)(18)治缠喉急喉风，双蛾肿痛，汤药难下： 雄黄一两，巴豆(去油)十四个，郁金一钱。为末，醋糊丸如绿豆大。茶清下七丸，吐出顽痰即苏。如口噤，以物斡开灌之。(《丹溪心法》雄黄解毒丸)(19)治小儿诸痫： 雄黄、朱砂等分。为末，每服一钱，猪心血水调。(《仁斋直指方》)(20)治癫痫卒倒，常愈常发： 雄黄(水飞过)、胆星(俱研细)、萆麻肉各等分。共研匀，米糊为丸，如绿豆大。每早饭后服一钱，白汤下。(《方脉正宗》)(21)治偏头疼： 雄黄、细辛等分。研令细。每用一字已下，左边疼吹入右鼻，右边疼吹入左鼻。(《博济方》至灵散)(22)治腹胁痞块： 雄黄一两，白矾一两。为末，面糊调膏摊贴。(《集玄方》)(23)治痔疮并肠红： 雄黄一钱五分，五倍子一两， 白矾二钱。共研末，乌梅肉为丸。每服一钱，空心白汤下。 (《医方易简》)(24)治积年冷瘘， 出黄水不瘥： 雄黄半两(细研)，清油三两，乱发半两，硫黄半两(细研)，黄蜡半两。上先以油煎乱发令焦尽，去滓，便入雄黄、硫黄及黄蜡，以慢火熬搅成膏，摊帛上贴之。(《圣惠方》雄黄膏)(25)治布鲁氏菌病后遗症： 雄黄一两，大蒜六十瓣。将雄黄研细，大蒜捣烂，配制成六十丸。每次一丸，一日三次。连服二十天为一疗程。(《全展选编·传染病》)"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-jberwrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-jberwrw","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ew3nkhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ew3nkhl","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.治疗慢性交气管炎及支气管哮喘：取明雄黄500g，白糊为丸1000粒。成人每服1丸，10-15岁每服 1／2丸，5-9岁每服 1／3丸，2-4岁每服 1／4丸，每日3次，温开水送服。治疗慢性支气管炎39例(其中喘息性交气管炎19例)、支气管哮喘11例，效果：治愈(症状消失未再发)16例，显着好转(症状消失，但感冒或劳累过度时仍有轻微症状)14例，症状减轻9例，无效5例(均合并肺气肿、支气管扩张)，因效果不明显中断治疗6人。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-czj6s2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-czj6s2b","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.治疗热带性嗜伊红细胞增多症：雄黄中含有三硫化二砷，用以试治本病 1例，结果取得明显效果。用量：每次4分，日服2次。服后4天气促、咳嗽均减轻，肺部罗音消失，血检白细胞由18300／mm3降为8400／mm3，嗜伊红细胞由63%降为24%，X线胸片复查与治疗前对比有明显吸收，自觉症状消失出院。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-c1rpt7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-c1rpt7k","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.治疗带状疱疹：取雄黄粉50g，加入75%酒精100ml混合。每天搽敷2次。如疼痛剧烈，可在雄黄酊中加入2%普鲁卡因20ml。治疗125例，皆有效。疗程平均为5.8天。无副作用及后遣症。另有用雄黄5g，冰片0.5g，酒精10Oml混合外搽患部，每日4-6次。治疗10例，一般在搽药 1-2天后疼痛减轻，水泡萎缩，红肿逐渐消退，以后自行脱皮而愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-re06xuc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-re06xuc","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.治疗翼状胬肉：取雄黄3分，生矾 1钱，共研细粉末装入有色瓶内，置阴凉处备用。患者取仰卧位，先作眼科常规麻醉及消毒。用开睑器撑开眼睑，嘱患者斜视健侧，使胬肉充分暴露，以消毒小棉棒蘸取少量药粉，涂于胬肉表面，待 1-2分钟(过长无效)用有齿小镊子将胬肉头部挟起，逆胬肉伸展方向揭扯，待撕至半月皱襞处，用无菌小剪从胬肉根部剪下，再在根部涂少量药粉。待渗血停止，将残留之胬肉提净，并将多余之药粉加以清除，敷以眼药膏，外加包扎，次日揭去敷料，点眼药水数天即愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-1lyb4s0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-1lyb4s0","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.治疗破伤风：用雄黄粉5钱，豆腐0.5斤(为成人1日量)儿童酌减。法将豆腐中心挖孔，雄黄滇于孔内，用挖出之豆腐覆盖，水煮1小时。待痉挛停止时将豆腐连汤分3次服下，连服5天，曾治2例，均愈。但由于病例尚少，需继续在实践中验证。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-lxd76o0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-lxd76o0","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.治疗流行性腮腺炎：用雄黄45g，明矾50g，冰片3-5g，共研细末，装入有色瓶中密闭备用。每次取3-5g置小杯中，酌加75%酒精调成糊状，涂于局部。日涂2-3次。治疗16例(腮腺高度肿胀， 体温在38℃左右)，1-2天后即明显消肿，体温恢复正常，第3天症状完全消失。较对症治疗组(计20例，疗程为5-15天)疗程明显缩短。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-yk4fiji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-yk4fiji","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.中毒与解毒：曾报告内服含砒雄黄急性中毒致死 1例，中毒主要症状为上吐下泻。市售雄黄混含砒霜，药用时应注意选择，以红黄色状如鸡冠者质较纯粹，如为白色结晶或碾碎时外红中白者，均为含有砒霜之征，用时须特别慎重。中毒后之急救方法，可用防已3钱；或生甘草 1份，绿豆2份，煎浓汁频服。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-hb82yue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-hb82yue","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-bgwidex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-bgwidex","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：雄黄，乃治疮杀毒要药也，而入肝经气分，故肝风，肝气，惊痫，痰涎，头痛眩晕，暑疟泄痢，积聚诸病，用之有殊功；又能化血为水。而方士乃炼治服饵，神异其说，被其毒者多矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-fl2pj8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-fl2pj8d","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：雄黄，味苦平，气寒有毒，《别录》加甘、大温，甄权言辛、大毒，察其功用，应是辛苦温之药，而甘寒则非也。其主寒热，鼠瘘，恶疮，疽痔，死肌，疥虫，疮请证，皆湿热留滞肌肉所致，久则浸淫面生虫，此药苦辛，能燥湿杀虫，故为疮家要药。其主鼻中息肉者，肺气结也，癖气者，大肠积滞也，筋骨断绝者，气血不续也，辛能散结滞，温能通行气血，辛温相合而杀虫，故能搜剔百节中大风积聚也。雄黄性热有毒，外用亦见具所长，内服难免其无害，凡在服饵，中病乃已，毋尽剂也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-beegvd9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-beegvd9","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经》：主寒热，鼠瘘，恶疮，疽痔，死肌，杀百虫毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-ag2g756","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-ag2g756","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《别录》：疗疥虫，疮，目痛，鼻中息肉及绝筋破骨，百节中大风，积聚，癖气，中恶腹痛，杀诸蛇虺毒，解藜芦毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-jb61pkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-jb61pkn","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《日华子本草》：治疥癣，风邪，癫痫，岚瘴，一切蛇虫犬兽咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-y7puimc","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-y7puimc","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611112145-rm78ito","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-rm78ito","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240611112145-nehy8pd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-nehy8pd","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王好古：搜肝气，泻肝风，消涎积。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-wof13db","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-wof13db","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《纲目》：治疟疾寒热，伏暑泄痢，酒饮成癖，惊痫，头风眩晕，化腹中瘀血，杀劳虫疳虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-jjmcvqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-jjmcvqx","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草正》：治痈疽腐肉，并鼠瘘、疽、痔等毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-o7oqbp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-o7oqbp3","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611112145-o056y8n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112145-o056y8n","updated":"20240611112145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611112147-bqedu03","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611112147-bqedu03"}},{"ID":"20240611112148-9jqpv70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611112148-9jqpv70"}}]}